stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> in_consultation : PATCH start-consultation<br/>creates the encounter
    in_consultation --> on_hold : PATCH send-for-test
    on_hold --> waiting : PATCH return-from-test
    waiting --> called : call next or select
    called --> in_consultation : start-consultation again<br/>same encounter reused
    in_consultation --> completed : PATCH complete or force-complete<br/>charges created
    in_consultation --> aborted : PATCH abort<br/>no charges
    in_consultation --> transferred : transfer<br/>new entry, new encounter later
    completed --> [*]
    aborted --> [*]
    transferred --> [*]
